Chapter: LeafLetIf

  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Regression: a pure leaf whose body is `let x = e in if ... then ... else x`
 took the minimal-leaf fast path, whose leaf-profile under-counted the
 anonymous locals emit-let allocates for the if in value position
 (compare spill + result). The self-check then halted with
 CDX2000 "minimal leaf mispredict". Fixed by falling back to the
 standard emitter on a mispredict instead of erroring.

Section: Body

  nd : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  nd (current) (total) = let next = current + 1 in if next >= total then 0 else next

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("nd 2 4 = " & show (nd 2 4))
    print-line-uni ("nd 9 4 = " & show (nd 9 4))
    print-line-uni ("nd 0 1 = " & show (nd 0 1))
  end

